  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Infallible blessed land, Chen Yi blocks Fang Yuan near Hairy Foot Mountain when a chest painting of a tall tree awakens as Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s arrangement. He activates Karma Divine Tree, then hears Genesis Lotus’s voice name the consecutive move. As the tree sways, Fang Yuan’s myriad fusion ghost dragon sword vanishes to a great distance, and later casts send Wu Yong to Southern Border, Heavenly Lord Bai Zu’s main body to Eastern Sea, and others away while fruits on the tree are spent. Fang Yuan judges that weak moves do not spend fruits, strong ones can spend one fruit each, and teleportation past his control range breaks his moves and risks backlash. After the fruits are gone the tree fades and Chen Yi is left extremely weak.",
      "chapters": [
        1740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_infallible_blessed_land",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_hairy_foot_mountain",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
        "move_karma_divine_tree",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fight in Lang Ya blessed land, Genesis Lotus’s voice again names Karma Relocation as the consecutive move on karma divine tree. Chen Yi uses it to gather with Feng Jiu Ge, pass him Immortal Gu, and transport Feng Jiu Ge away; the super formation and Lang Ya’s aperture walls cannot stop that exit. The move is a rank nine killer move, and Fang Yuan already knows there is no way to block it.",
      "chapters": [
        1761
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After searching Chen Yi’s soul, Fang Yuan obtains two Genesis Lotus true inheritances, karma divine tree and karma relocation. Karma relocation is a movement method based on karma divine tree that does not target the user, but others around him such as Gu Immortals, plants, beasts, or killer moves. It is Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s creation, and Fang Yuan is far from recreating its true power.",
      "chapters": [
        1781
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritances-and-limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later he still cannot restore karma relocation for the moment even after improving his karma divine tree.",
      "chapters": [
        1859
      ],
